@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041

### 1. Initialize handshake — dokazuje da MCP server zivi i odgovara na JSON-RPC protokol
# @name initialize
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "rucni-test", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}

### 2. tools/list — dokazuje da server izlaze stvarne alate (pretrazi_kontrolne_tocke, dohvati_kontrolnu_tocku)
# Mcp-Session-Id se uzima iz odgovora na zahtjev 1 (header "Mcp-Session-Id")
# @name toolsList
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{initialize.response.headers.Mcp-Session-Id}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}

### 3. tools/call — stvarni upit nad bazom za Juzni Velebit (idPodrucje = 13)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{initialize.response.headers.Mcp-Session-Id}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "pretrazi_kontrolne_tocke",
    "arguments": { "idPodrucje": 13 }
  }
}
